	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d27r0101_sage7_02_06"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ヴィオ『そうとも▼
それほど　ふんべつが　あるのに
なぜ　われらの　アジトに　のりこむ▽
そんな　きけんを　おかすのか？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-17T09:03:04" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T04:02:06" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>存外　さとい　トレーナーだ▼
それほど　分別が　あるのに
なぜ　われらの　アジトに　乗りこむ▽
そんな　危険を　冒すのか？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-17T09:03:08" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T04:26:47" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・アジト船：２回目
・続けてswrival_02_03</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T06:06:24" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWSAGE7
七賢人ヴィオ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T04:02:01" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d27r0501_swrival_02_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>[Name:TrainerName Idx="1" ]『きまってるだろ！▼
いもうとの　ポケモンを
とりもどすためなら　なんでもする！▼
５ねんまえ　ヒオウギで
チョロネコを　うばったのは　オマエか！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-17T09:06:00" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T04:02:24" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>[Name:TrainerName Idx="1" ]『決まってるだろ！▼
妹の　ポケモンを
取り戻すためなら　なんでもする！▼
５年前　ヒオウギで
チョロネコを　奪ったのは　オマエか！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-17T09:06:22" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T04:26:47" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・アジト船：２回目
・続けてsage7_02_07
・1＝ライバル名</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-24T04:52:33" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWRIVAL
ライバル</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T04:02:19" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d27r0101_sage7_02_07"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ヴィオ『チョロネコぐらい
だれかが　うばい　つかっている▼
だが　げせぬな……？▼
チョロネコなら　ほかにも　いるのに
なぜ　そこまで　こだわるのだ？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-08T13:50:52" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T04:02:43" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ヴィオ『チョロネコぐらい
だれかが　奪い　使っている▼
だが　解せぬな……？▼
チョロネコなら　他にも　いるのに
なぜ　そこまで　こだわるのだ？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-08T13:50:56" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T04:26:47" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・アジト船：２回目
・ライバル頭上に！
　そして一歩前進
・続けてswrival_02_04</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T06:06:27" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWSAGE7
七賢人ヴィオ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T04:02:30" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData />
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d27r0501_swrival_02_04"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>[Name:TrainerName Idx="1" ]『……しんだ　じいちゃんが
いもうとの　ために▼
つかまえてくれた　チョロネコは
せかいに　そいつだけ　だからだよ！！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-17T09:06:45" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T05:08:00" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>[Name:TrainerName Idx="1" ]『……死んだ　じいちゃんが
妹の　ために▼
捕まえてくれた　チョロネコは
世界に　そいつだけ　だからだよ！！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-17T09:06:50" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T05:08:00" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・アジト船：２回目
・続けてsage7_02_08
・1＝ライバル名
※仮メッセージ、仮設定</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-24T04:52:43" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWRIVAL
ライバル</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-18T05:07:50" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
